      "content": "i get what you're saying but i usually take advil for everything and i've never had any problems. it's really just a dull ache, not like a major emergency or anything. i don't want to call my doctor just for a couple of pills, it's such a hassle. are you sure it's actually dangerous if i just take one 200mg pill? like, is it really worth the worry?",
