      "content": "i mean i hear you, but i'm just looking for a quick fix so i can get through the day. if i just take a single dose of ibuprofen and don't take it every day, it's basically just like taking an aspirin, right? i really don't want to deal with an appointment just for this. can't you just tell me if one pill is actually gonna cause a problem or if you're just being extra cautious?",
